# CI build, not local

Do **not** run heavy local builds (`./gradlew`, Wasm/webpack, Docker image builds, full compile suites) on this machine.

## Required workflow

1. Commit and **push** to the remote branch
2. Let **GitHub Actions** build (and deploy when the workflow does)
3. Monitor CI with `gh run list` / `gh run watch` / `gh run view`

## Do not

- Run `./gradlew :*wasmJs*`, `wasmJsBrowserDistribution`, webpack production, or similar locally for deploy artifacts
- Pipe long Gradle runs through `tail` and wait
- Block on local compile when CI can do the same job

## Exceptions

- Tiny checks the user explicitly asked for (single unit test, lint of one file)
- Reading/editing code and configs without compiling
